WEBVTT

00:01:28.919 --> 00:01:30.895
"Look, this is new,"

00:01:30.919 --> 00:01:33.093
and, preferably, "good."

00:01:34.061 --> 00:01:38.918
So, purely random changes aren't novelty.

00:01:38.942 --> 00:01:44.149
OK, Heraclitus did say
a man can't step in the same river twice,

00:01:44.173 --> 00:01:46.990
because it's not the same river,
he's not the same man.

00:01:47.307 --> 00:01:51.399
But if the river is changing randomly,

00:01:51.423 --> 00:01:53.819
it really is the same river.

00:01:54.311 --> 00:01:55.764
In contrast,

00:01:55.788 --> 00:02:00.399
if an idea in a mind
spreads to other minds,